---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getPythonEntries } from '../../lib/python-library';

const entries = getPythonEntries();
const topics = ['基础语法', '函数', '数据结构', '文件与异常', '练习项目'];
const groups = [...topics, ...new Set(entries.map((entry) => entry.topic).filter((topic) => !topics.includes(topic)))];
---
<BaseLayout title="Python 学习 | 沅泽的学习博客" description="整理 Python 学习代码、简短注释与学习要点。">
  <div class="container python-page">
    <div class="eyebrow">Python learning notebook</div>
    <h1>Python 学习</h1>
    <p class="python-lead">把练习过的代码按主题收好。每份代码保留原本的写法，旁边记录用途、关键点和还没弄懂的地方。</p>
    <div class="python-overview">
      <div><strong>{entries.length}</strong><span>份代码记录</span></div>
      <div><strong>{topics.length}</strong><span>个起步主题</span></div>
      <p>这里展示的是仓库里的 <code>python-code/</code> 文件。新增 <code>.py</code> 文件后，下次构建会自动出现在对应主题中。</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="python-topics" aria-label="Python 学习主题">
      {groups.map((topic) => <a href={`#topic-${groups.indexOf(topic)}`}>{topic}</a>)}
    </nav>

    {groups.map((topic, index) => {
      const items = entries.filter((entry) => entry.topic === topic);
      return (
        <section class="python-section" id={`topic-${index}`} aria-labelledby={`heading-${index}`}>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2 id={`heading-${index}`}>{topic}</h2>
            <span class="muted">{items.length} 份代码</span>
          </div>
          {items.length ? (
            <div class="post-list">
              {items.map((entry) => (
                <a class="post-card" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}python/${entry.slug}/`}>
                  <div class="post-meta"><span>{entry.file}</span>{entry.date && <time datetime={entry.date}>原文件更新 {entry.date}</time>}</div>
                  <h3>{entry.title}</h3>
                  <p>{entry.summary || '查看代码与学习注释'}</p>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          ) : <p class="empty-topic">还没有代码。把练习文件放进 <code>python-code/{topic}/</code> 后就会显示在这里。</p>}
        </section>
      );
    })}
    <aside class="python-help">
      <h2>如何添加学习代码？</h2>
      <p>把你写的 <code>.py</code> 文件放进相应主题目录，或者直接发给我。我会保留原本逻辑，补少量解释性注释；如果代码有错误，会单独说明，不会悄悄改掉。</p>
      <p class="muted">公开博客里的代码对所有人可见，提交前需要检查密码、令牌、个人路径和私人数据。</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
